     A                                  1 26'HELP SCREEN FOR CREATING QUOTES'
     A                                  2 24'----------------------------------'
     A                                  4  1'1.  BUYER CODE:      MUST BE ENTER-
     A                                      ED AND WILL BE VALIDATED.'
     A                                  6  1'2.  RETURN DATE:     THIS WILL PRI-
     A                                      NT ON THE QUOTE SHEET AS THE DATE'
     A                                  6 69'BY WHICH'
     A                                  7  9'THE VENDOR SHOULD RETURN THE FORM'
     A                                  7 43'TO THE BUYER. MUST BE A FUTURE DAT-
     A                                      E.'
     A                                  9  1'3.  VENDOR CODE:     A COPY OF THE'
     A                                  9 36'QUOTE SHEET WILL BE PRINTED FOR EA-
     A                                      CH VENDOR'
     A                                 10  9'ENTERED.  VENDOR CODES WILL BE VAL-
     A                                      IDATED THE FIRST TIME "ENTER" IS'
     A                                 11  9'PRESSED AND MAY NOT BE CHANGED AGA-
     A                                      IN UNTIL A NEW QUOTE IS STARTED.'
     A                                 13  1'4.  CORPORATE/REQUISITION CODE:  U-
     A                                      P TO 21 CODES MAY BE ENTERED AT A'
     A                                 13 69'TIME.'
     A                                 14  9'CODE CAN BE A CORPORATE CODE OR A'
     A                                 14 43'CODED OR NONCODED REQUISITION.'
     A                                 15  9'PRESSING "ENTER" WILL VALIDATE THA-
     A                                      T EACH CODE EXISTS.  IF MORE CODES'
     A                                 16  9'ARE NEEDED, ENTER "X" OR "N" IN TH-
     A                                      E LAST FIELD BEFORE PRESSING "ENTER-
     A                                      ".'
     A                                 17  9'IF "X" OR "N" IS NOT FILLED IN, TH-
     A                                      EN PRESSING "ENTER" WILL ADVANCE TO-
     A                                      '
     A                                 18  9'THE QUOTE PARAGRAPH SCREEN.'
     A                                 20  1'NOTE:  BID QUANTITIES WILL BE FILL-
     A                                      ED IN WITH THE ACTUAL USAGE AMOUNT'
     A                                 20 70'FOR THE'
     A                                 21  8'LAST 12 MONTHS.  THIS CAN BE CHANG-
     A                                      ED IN THE QUOTE MODIFY PROGRAM.'
