     A                                  2  1'-----------------------------------
     A                                      ------------------------------------
     A                                      ----------'
     A                                  3  1'NOTE 1:  Enter quote number OR a d-
     A                                      ate, but not both fields at the sam-
     A                                      e time.'
     A                                  4 10'If "Y" is answered to display data'
     A                                  4 45'before deleting, you will always'
     A                                  5 10'be able to change your mind about'
     A                                  5 44'deleting the quote.'
     A                                  7  1'QUOTE:  Enter quote number if only'
     A                                  7 36'one quote is to be deleted.  If th-
     A                                      e question'
     A                                  8  9'"display quote data before deletin-
     A                                      g?" is "N" for no, the quote will'
     A                                  8 77'be'
     A                                  9  9'deleted in a job.  If answered "Y"'
     A                                  9 44'for yes, the quote data will be'
     A                                 10  9'filled in and you will have a choi-
     A                                      ce of pressing f1 to save the quote-
     A                                      '
     A                                 11  9'or f2 to go ahead and delete the q-
     A                                      uote.'
     A                                 13  1'ALL QUOTES OLDER THAN DATE:  If a'
     A                                 13 35'range of quotes is to be deleted b-
     A                                      ased on'
     A                                 14  1'its expiration date, then quote nu-
     A                                      mber is left blank and the date is'
     A                                 14 70'entered in'
     A                                 15  1'this field.  Any quotes with an ex-
     A                                      piration date older than this enter-
     A                                      ed date'
     A                                 16  1'will be deleted.  If a "N" is ente-
     A                                      red to the question "display quote'
     A                                 16 70'data befor'
     A                                 17  1'deleting?", then the quotes will b-
     A                                      e deleted automatically from a job;-
     A                                       otherwise'
     A                                 18  1'the quotes will be displayed one a-
     A                                      t a time and you have a choice of'
     A                                 18 69'pressing'
     A                                 19  1'f1 to save a quote or f2 to delete'
     A                                 19 36'a quote.'
     A                                 21  1'Note 2:  A report of quotes based'
     A                                 21 35'on expiration date is produced fro-
     A                                      m QR4.'
     A                                 22 10'Quotes without expiration dates is'
     A                                 22 45'produced from QR6.'
